        "alt": "Bake the salmon",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "id": "step-2",
      "heading": "Cook the noodles",
      "blocks": [
        "Bring the boiled water and {{noodle-salt}} salt to a boil in a saucepan. Cook the noodles for 4 minutes until tender. Drain and rinse under cold water to stop sticking."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Cook the noodles",
          "seconds": [
            240
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image": {
        "id": "sweet-chilli-salmon-noodles-2-sketch",
        "path": "media/sweet-chilli-salmon-noodles-2-sketch.webp",
        "alt": "Cook the noodles",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "id": "step-3",
      "heading": "Stir-fry the pea pods",
      "blocks": [
        "Peel and grate or press the garlic. Halve the pea pods lengthways. Heat oil in a large frying pan over medium-high and stir-fry the pea pods for 3–4 minutes until tender."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Stir-fry the pea pods",
          "seconds": [
            180,
            240
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image": {
        "id": "sweet-chilli-salmon-noodles-3-sketch",
        "path": "media/sweet-chilli-salmon-noodles-3-sketch.webp",
        "alt": "Stir-fry the pea pods",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "id": "step-4",
      "heading": "Add the sauce",
      "blocks": [
        "Stir-fry the garlic and coleslaw mix with the pea pods for another 30 seconds. Add hoisin, soy and {{sauce-water}} water. Bring to a boil, then lower the heat and simmer for 2–3 minutes."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Simmer the sauce",
          "seconds": [
            120,
            180
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image": {
        "id": "sweet-chilli-salmon-noodles-4-sketch",
        "path": "media/sweet-chilli-salmon-noodles-4-sketch.webp",
        "alt": "Add the sauce",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "id": "step-5",
      "heading": "Toss the noodles",
      "blocks": [
        "Add the cooked noodles and toss to coat in the sauce."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [],
      "image": {
        "id": "sweet-chilli-salmon-noodles-5-sketch",
